WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.040
Just being at your side,

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:16.160
Gentles my hearts to the point of disbelief

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:25.570
I thought I heard the sound of your footsteps behind me,

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:35.720
I turned my head repeatedly, wishing you would appear...

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.740
...and then there you were

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:50.990
The beginning of a new love

00:00:51.310 --> 00:01:05.870
Is unknowingly, the beginning of our invisible love story

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:15.360
Hence, I shall never leave your side

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.540
I pledge to love you and only you

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:37.190
<i>It was Chise.</i>

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:49.810
"What I Want to Protect"

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:52.010
<i>What had happened?</i>

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:54.610
<i>What had she done?</i>

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:58.850
<i>No, Chise protected this town.</i>

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:03.230
<i>If it weren't for her... this town...</i>

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:14.270
Shu...ji...?

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:21.280
Don't... please!

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:28.050
Shuji, don't , we're... only classmates now.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:30.180
We shouldn't...

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:37.550
Chise!

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:38.690
Shuji!

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:47.740
Shuji...

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:50.640
Why are you doing this?

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:57.480
We shouldn't do this if we're just classmates!

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:03.920
I'm sorry, Chise. I didn't want to hurt you again...

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:07.130
Shuji...

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.620
Shuji, I can't take this!

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:12.840
Shuji...

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.260
I can't stand being away from you!

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.870
I can't stand it!

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.810
Shuji...

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:41.690
Shuji, what's wrong?

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.060
<i>Don't look away from her!</i>

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.740
<i>Don't look away!</i>

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:53.700
Shuji?

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:58.270
<i>Look at her...</i> <i>straight in her eyes!</i>

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:05.880
Oh, don't worry.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:10.280
They all died instantly...

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:15.990
Don't worry, they didn't feel anything.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.900
Shuji...

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:29.230
Shuji, sorry!

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:31.880
I...

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.950
Never mind... I have to go...

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:42.580
Chise!

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.430
<i>The streets were filled with</i> <i>noise and confusion.</i>

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:59.530
<i>Eventually, the flames died down,</i> <i>and in the morning,</i>

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:02.370
<i>the people of the town</i>

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.940
<i>would see the truth.</i>

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:12.680
<i>That night, the peace this town</i> <i>had known... ended.</i>

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:35.370
You see? Something's wrong...

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:38.670
The girls are saying they broke up.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.450
I wonder if she dumped Shuji...

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:46.720
<i>No, we just went back</i> <i>to being classmates.</i>

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:52.150
<i>Since that day,</i> <i>I didn't even try to talk to Chise.</i>

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.290
<i>We were even less than classmates.</i>

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:04.170
<i>What's Atsushi doing, I wonder?</i>

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:08.770
<i>On his way to battle?</i>

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:15.110
But maybe it's not so bad to die

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:19.420
for your family... and the girl you love.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.360
<i>Atsushi, you know...</i>

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:28.590
<i>I'm useless, I can't do a damn thing.</i>

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:00.390
Cutting class for that?

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:04.930
Uh, I've got the other half here...

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:05.900
That's OK.

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:11.500
I don't even want to be in a picture being ogled like that. It's too gross!

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.380
Hey, it's not gross!

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.660
You broke up with Chise?

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.170
Idiot!

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:26.010
We didn't break up, Chise wanted to go back...

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.850
to being just classmates.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:32.230
You can just decide and do that?

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:34.990
How should I know?!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:40.520
I don't understand her. I don't understand myself, for that matter.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:44.800
I make a lousy boyfriend.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:48.100
I tried so hard to understand her,

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.880
but all I did was hurt her.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:57.950
Break up? Shuji said that?

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:01.350
Did that fool say he wanted to break up?

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:05.190
No, we decided together.

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:12.020
I don't really want to be in love anymore.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:13.660
Chise!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:16.830
I don't care if I never do again.

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.810
Are you sure about that, Chise?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:26.610
So if another girl likes Shuji and takes him,

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:28.010
you don't mind?

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:33.480
I'm so miserable!

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:37.610
I don't want to hurt him anymore.

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:42.780
So I'm giving up on love.

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:51.370
Akemi, I've tried as hard as I can to forget him...

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:55.410
but I can't!

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:58.470
I've never felt like this before!

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:05.220
Why won't my feelings for him disappear?!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:07.620
They won't go away!

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:14.260
Why is love so hard?

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:17.590
How do people do it?

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:22.870
How do you know what a girl's thinking?

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:26.310
How can I understand her feelings?

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.470
Do you have ESP?

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:34.270
Who can say what a woman feels?

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:39.080
Can any man really understand a woman?

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:46.100
If I liked a guy, and he really understood my feelings...

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:49.430
I'd die of embarrassment.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:53.680
I don't want a guy to understand me.

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:59.540
Anyway, that's what Chise would say, I guess.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:04.370
Sorry, I should mind my own business.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.310
Yeah, right!

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:11.360
Well, anyway, we're both too dumb to talk about such difficult stuff.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:12.710
Right, Akemi?

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:13.780
Yup!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.880
Shuji, we're just dumb jocks!

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:21.260
Yeah.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:43.370
That's Akemi's swing.

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:50.180
In elementary school, she'd never let me sit there, for some reason.

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:54.280
Don't sweat it. Akemi didn't pay for this swing...

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:59.600
She said if I ever sat there, we wouldn't be friends.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:04.100
So even now, I don't sit there.

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:10.170
It's funny. If she knew the truth, we wouldn't be friends anyway.

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:13.900
Dummy! She's not like that! She's...

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:19.510
I know, she always said she'd look out for me.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:20.780
Yeah.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.580
I can't do anything in return.

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:26.790
Not for you, or Akemi.

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:31.630
I'm a weapon now, so I only destroy things.

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:34.050
I can't protect anything.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.860
I'm not strong at all!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:48.570
Chise, the other day... did you do all that?

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:53.250
Yeah, on my way home. It was easy.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:57.850
I let my guard down just for a few seconds.

00:11:57.920 --> 00:12:01.490
They never miss a chance.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:07.060
They don't have many missiles or drones left.

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:14.770
There were about 20 or 30 of them... all young.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.210
I killed them all in a flash.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.880
Can you still love a girl like me?

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:31.080
I do!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.720
But...

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:38.420
Chise! Tomorrow let's skip school and go see the sea lions and dolphins!

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.130
We'll go to the aquarium tomorrow.

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:42.000
Shuji...

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:45.600
We promised we'd go again!

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:48.210
Chise, let's go!

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:55.550
This time, you hold the money.

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:59.480
Yeah, I'll take care of it.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:06.920
<i>Shuji...</i>

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:22.550
"To Shuji"

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:29.340
<i>"Shuji, I'm sorry."</i>

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:35.310
<i>"I've broken another promise.</i> <i>I have to go for a while."</i>

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:39.160
<i>"I'm glad you still love me."</i>

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.350
<i>"I love you, too."</i>

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:45.400
<i>"But, let's just be classmates, after all."</i>

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:51.970
<i>"PS. Please don't be afraid of me."</i>

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.430
<i>"Don't hate me."</i>

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.870
<i>That day, Chise didn't come to school.</i>

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:06.010
<i>She never came to school again.</i>

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.160
Damn them!

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:16.460
I'll kill 'em all!

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:19.390
I'll avenge everyone!

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:23.370
Keep it down, will you? You make too much noise.

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:25.560
Is war supposed to be quiet?!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:29.800
Fool, fighting your own side...

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:35.340
My own side?! I've lost my entire family!

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.140
I'm my own side!

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:41.930
Damn it! How did I get into this mess?

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:44.350
Who cares?

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:49.290
Keep quiet. This girl here's not whining.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.690
<i>Akemi... Shuji...</i>

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:58.130
<i>Things are much worse than I thought.</i>

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:00.740
It's Chise!

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:02.850
Isn't that Chise?

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:06.800
If it's Chise then... it's all over.

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:09.380
You're kidding me...

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:10.770
Crap!

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:15.610
<i>What's up there? What's this "Chise"?</i>

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:36.640
Shuji? Shouldn't you be in school?

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.900
How's everyone?

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:43.150
Fine. More or less.

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:46.550
How are you and Chise doing?

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:48.120
Fine.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:50.530
I see.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:59.430
What about you? Are you still... you know...

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:01.670
about Take...?

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:04.400
What? Don't be silly.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:11.170
Take's dead and gone. I can't drag that behind me forever.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:15.950
In a world like this, if you love someone,

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.540
you never know when you might lose him.

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:24.330
So falling truly in love, what's the point?

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.400
All, dismount!

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:37.370
Fall in!

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:42.600
The station below is your temporary quarters.

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:45.580
Secure your sleeping area,

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:49.340
and fall in at 1530 hours!

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:50.630
Yes sir!

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:55.150
On the way here, I saw Chise!

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:59.500
Then it's true. I heard Chise's coming too.

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:04.020
So it won't be long before this place is...

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.560
Shit!

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:08.230
Uh, what is this "Chise"?

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:11.900
You'll find out soon enough!

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:15.840
Is it some kind of amazing new weapon?

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:19.200
You idiot! "Weapon" doesn't come close!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:23.180
Yeah, weapons are just cute little things next to her!

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:26.180
She's...The Angel of Death!

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.390
Commander Chise,

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:40.990
well done.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:46.760
The Chief of Staff's representative was pleased with what he saw.

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:48.540
Spare me the details.

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:50.510
What's next?

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:54.680
The Chief of Staff's representative asked

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:59.110
if you could brief the troops and recruits

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:00.830
at 1600 hours today...

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.580
Seems you didn't hear me.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:03.590
Ma'am?

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.920
I'm asking you what my next mission is.

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:09.580
I-I'm sorry, Ma'am!

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:14.320
You will fight to the end, even at the cost of your life!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:18.410
This is what you have been trained for!

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:23.870
Show what it means to have an unyielding will to win!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:28.310
As defenders of our nation, fight for the sake of your unit!

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:31.680
Remember your honor, responsibility and mission!

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:34.540
Huh?

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.360
I'm back where I started.

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.520
Oh man,

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.160
I'm lost.

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:45.680
Now we will hear a few words from a female officer

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:50.860
at the heart of our national defense, and our forces' guardian angel.

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:56.780
Commander, Special Unit...

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:59.460
Attached to the Northern Battle Group...

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:02.540
code name..."Chise"!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:09.550
<i>Don't say you can only destroy, Chise!</i>

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:13.350
<i>Don't say you can't protect, Chise!</i>

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:16.340
<i>This town is where you...</i>

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:28.270
<i>What's taking so long? Hurry, please...</i>

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:38.050
Commander Chise, Ito here.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:39.450
It's open.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:41.720
Excuse me...

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:42.720
A mission?

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.960
Uh, we're on standby!

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:53.530
The situation has changed. We are ordered to stand by indefinitely.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.790
Stand by? Um...

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:58.190
That's all. Excuse me...

00:19:58.470 --> 00:19:59.580
Um...

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:01.610
Please let me fight!

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.800
But...

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:08.790
Please! I don't want to... rest!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:11.180
But our orders...

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.710
Please, let me fight!

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:15.250
Those are our orders!

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:16.350
Excuse me!

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.560
Please... let me fight!

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:22.990
Let me fight!

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:26.960
I have to get stronger...

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:29.790
Merciless?

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:33.400
Yeah. Never seen anything like it.

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:35.300
What is this, "Chise"?

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:38.170
I don't really know.

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:40.240
Who could, after seeing that?

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:42.940
It's impossible to understand.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:46.980
If you want to know, ask the lieutenant there.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.950
He's the lone survivor of the "Chise Squad".

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:05.030
Uh, Lieutenant Tetsu? My name is-

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:06.500
Don't tell me.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:07.300
Huh?

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:11.770
Sorry, just don't want to know your name.

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:13.760
Uh, but...

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:17.310
You're just going to die, too...

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.470
Well, yeah, probably...

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:25.580
I don't want to know more dead people.

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:27.490
Sorry 'bout that.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:34.130
Around here, there're lots of things you're better off...

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:36.760
not knowing.

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:45.400
<i>Am I... growing?</i>

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:57.250
They're alive, Chise!

00:21:57.590 --> 00:21:59.560
The sea lions, the dolphins,

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.090
they're all fine!

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:04.530
See Chise? You protected them!

00:22:04.860 --> 00:22:08.130
You're not weak! Don't say you can't do anything!

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:11.190
See?! They're still alive!

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:16.270
Shuji...!

00:22:18.760 --> 00:22:21.910
<i>Chise, there's something we can still do.</i>

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:28.440
<i>I don't know what that is,</i> <i>but I'm sure there's something we can protect.</i>

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.420
A rift opened up upon my heart

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:49.990
And I went through the night sleepless, sighing constantly

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:59.340
Before I realize, it's turned to morning

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:08.660
I want to hear your voice

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:13.250
I want to feel your warmth

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:19.460
Thoughts of you well up within me

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:25.310
And my tears begin to overflow

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:36.570
Goodbye my beloved, I am still unable to forget about you

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:46.740
Having all of this end with just a single word of goodbye

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:51.570
Fills me with sorrow

00:24:00.560 --> 00:24:04.280
Chise, how are you doing, there? Are you eating well?

00:24:04.350 --> 00:24:05.580
Do you have friends?

00:24:05.650 --> 00:24:09.590
Over here, there was a downed enemy pilot. It was quite a mess...

00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:14.960
